# A formal letter in Russian: уважаемый…
subtitle: "The heating is off and Tom must write to the management company: learn a polite Russian letter, from уважаемые господа to с уважением."
tags: ["russian","formal letter","russian writing","уважаемый","russian phrases"]
teaches: ["phrases/formal-letters","phrases/formal-register"]
thumb: "band \"A formal letter in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Word families in Russian: вход, выход, переход","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/122-russian-word-families.cast"}

